### 创建任务
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "任务C",
  "description": "测试C",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "startTime": "2026-09-10T19:00:00",
  "deadline": "2026-09-10T20:00:00"
}

### Agent 对话
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我创建明天晚上7点到8点的控笔训练任务，优先级高"
}

### 查询全部任务
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我创建明天19:00到20:00的控笔训练任务，描述是练习控笔，优先级高"
}